g-and-play transformer module for task-agnostic reasoning</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Kush</forename><surname>Bhatia</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Avanika</forename><surname>Narayan</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Christopher</forename><forename type=\"middle\">De</forename><surname>Sa</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Christopher</forename><surname>Ré</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<idno type=\"arXiv\">arXiv:2306.07536</idno>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2023\">2023</date>\n\t\t</imprint>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note type=\"report_type\">arXiv preprint</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b5\">\n\t<analytic>\n\t\t<title level=\"a\" type=\"main\">Language (technology) is power: A critical survey of &quot;bias&quot; in nlp</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Lin</forename><surname>Su</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Solon</forename><surname>Blodgett</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Hal</forename><surname>Barocas</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Iii</forename><surname>Daumé</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Hanna</forename><surname>Wallach</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t</analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\">Proceedings of the 58th Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics</title>\n\t\t<meeting>the 58th Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics</meeting>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2020\">2020</date>\n\t\t\t<biblScope unit=\"page\" from=\"5454\" to=\"5476\